        <span class="ml-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-white">hello.exe</span>
      </div>
      <div class="h-[1.2em]"></div>
      <div class="m-0 min-h-[1.2em] p-0">
        <pre
          class="block font-mono text-[10px] leading-none whitespace-pre text-cyan-600 sm:text-[6px] md:text-[8px] dark:text-cyan-400">
          _______   __    __  _______ ________  __       __                               __       
          |       \ |  \  |  \|       \        \|  \     /  \                             |  \      
          | $$$$$$$\| $$  | $$| $$$$$$$\$$$$$$$$| $$\   /  $$  ______    ______   ______  | $$   __ 
          | $$__/ $$| $$  | $$| $$__/ $$ | $$   | $$$\ /  $$$ /      \  /      \ |      \ | $$  /  \
