          | $$__/ $$| $$__/ $$| $$       | $$   | $$ \$$$| $$| $$$$$$$$| $$     |  $$$$$$$| $$$$$$\ 
          | $$    $$ \$$    $$| $$       | $$   | $$  \$ | $$ \$$     \| $$      \$$    $$| $$  \$$\
           \$$$$$$$   \$$$$$$  \$$        \$$    \$$      \$$  \$$$$$$$ \$$       \$$$$$$$ \$$   \$$
        </pre>
      </div>
      <div class="h-[1.2em]"></div>
      <div class="m-0 min-h-[1.2em] p-0">
        <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">Welcome to the retro terminal!</span>
      </div>
      <div class="m-0 min-h-[1.2em] p-0">
        <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">System initialized successfully.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="m-0 min-h-[1.2em] p-0">
        <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">Ready for input...</span>
      </div>
      <div class="h-[1.2em]"></div>
      <div class="m-0 min-h-[1.2em] p-0">
        <span class="font-bold text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400">C:\&gt;</span>
